# Automatic GFS six-hour transition with licensed BADA 4 TEM.
# Requires cached 2025-08-15 12Z and 18Z GFS analysis files.
# Run with: IC research/gfs-tem-transition
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === GFS AUTOMATIC TIME TRANSITION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO Simulation starts at 17:59:30 and crosses into the cached 18:00 slot.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT GFS changes from 12:00 to 18:00 without fallback or BADA misses.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST EXPECT Matched level-flight REPORT and OFF propagation remains equivalent with no quality events.
00:00:00.20>DATE 15,8,2025,17:59:30
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD WINDGFS
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:00.42>METEOCONFIG STRICT ON
00:00:00.43>METEOCONFIG TIMEUPDATE ON
00:00:00.44>METEOCONFIG INTERPOLATION OFF
00:00:00.45>WINDGFS 40,-5,45,5
00:00:01.00>CRE GWTR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.00>CRE GWTO,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS GWTR TEM
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS GWTO TEM
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG GWTR PYBADA
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG GWTO PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS GWTR LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS GWTO LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE GWTR REPORT
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE GWTO OFF
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START gfs-tem-transition.csv
00:00:35.00>ECHO TEST ACTION The simulation UTC has crossed 18:00. Weather selection follows the exact UTC validity interval.
00:01:01.00>ATMOSSTATUS GWTR
00:01:01.00>ATMOSSTATUS GWTO
00:01:05.00>PERFSTATUS GWTR ALL
00:01:05.00>PERFSTATUS GWTO ALL
00:01:08.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:01:08.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_gfs_transition_run.py on output/gfs-tem-transition.csv.
00:01:09.00>HOLD
